\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 While I think my reading of the plural subject for 'filled' is more likely, I don't think we ought to rely on that instead of your reading unless we can find stronger evidence. But I think that for the most part, what we have both said works well enough on either interpretation; this is caution, not disagreement.\
