\f2 \uc0\u1489 \u1456 \u1468 \u1504 \u1462 \u1508 \u1462 \u1513 \u1473 
\f1  
\f2 \uc0\u1488 \u1464 \u1491 \u1464 \u1501 
\f1  as bearing divine image? Or does it allow the interior to fill with 
\f2 \uc0\u1495 \u1464 \u1502 \u1464 \u1505 
\f1  because the returns are good and the position seems secure?\
The king of Tyre is paradigm, not anomaly. The pattern recurs wherever gifts get mistaken for grounds of self-deification, wherever representative function gets collapsed into self-reference, wherever wisdom gets corrupted to serve the splendor it was supposed to point beyond.\
What remains to explore? The Sidon oracle (verses 20-24) and the restoration promise (verses 25-26) complete the chapter. Should we attend to how they function in relation to what we've traced?
