\b \cf2 How does this character enable generalization?
\b0 \
If the LORD only judged Tyre for Tyre-specific reasons, the passage would be historical curiosity. But the character revealed generalizes:\
Any entity whose heart is lifted up in its success is seen by this LORD. The positional security doesn't hide the heart's orientation. Whether commercial empire, technological system, or individual achiever \'97 the diagnosis penetrates.\
Any entity that corrupts given gifts for self-glorification falls under the same judgment pattern. Not because of arbitrary divine anger but because corruption of gift is what this LORD judges. The gifts remain good; the corruption is the problem. And this LORD distinguishes them precisely.\
Any entity that fills its midst with violence through its operations \'97 even unremarked violence, even violence that seems like just doing business \'97 accumulates material that can become consuming fire. This LORD sees what frameworks hide from themselves. The 
